div.p:
—limit new reprocessing capacity to that required for breeders, and limit
                    separation of plutonium to avoid unnecessary stockpiling and pressure for
                    thermal recycle;

—agree to US consent rights, as called for in the
                        NNPA, including their continuation over
                    material after use in breeder RD&D programs;

—adopt predictable ground rules for exercise of consent rights over reprocessing
                    and plutonium use in specified breeder and other advanced reactor RD&D
                    programs;
